[en.FOCUS_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS]
Bribe Imperial Officials

[en.FOCUS_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_desc]
The news that the rock farm is actively expanding its military and preparing for war is bound to leak out, and Cozy Glow would never believe that I would simply comply. By bribing a large number of the imperial officials around Cozy Glow and proactively demanding an increase in the empire’s taxes—though this is not a long-term solution—it will at least allow her to let her guard down temporarily.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS]
贿赂帝国官员

[zh.FOCUS_C12_BRIBE_IMPERIAL_OFFICIALS_desc]
我们积极扩军备战的消息必然会走漏风声，同时可西也不会相信我会乖乖听话，通过贿赂可西光辉身边大量的帝国官员并主动要求提高帝国的赋税，虽然不是长久之计，但至少能让她暂时放松警惕。

